#============================================================================
# MENU DASHBOARDS — PURE SYMBOLIC ZEROPOINT SPECIFICATIONS
# Date: 2026-03-27
# Purpose: Define what each dashboard MUST show and how it must work
# Format: Pure symbolic (no implementation code, no algorithms)
