## DASHBOARD 7: REALITY ENGINE (⊗)

Primitive: Environment consistency — Is system state as expected or anomalous?

Data flow:
  ledger_sync_config.json (sync settings)
  + ledger_app_state.jsonl (current state)
    → check: which apps registered as active
    → verify: each app's last heartbeat timestamp (is it recent?)
    → verify: state consistency (no contradictions in ledger)
    → display: app status, last seen time, overall consistency verdict

Output format:
  Reality Engine — Environment State

  Active Applications:
    tkinter_canvas:   [ACTIVE]      last heartbeat: 2026-03-27T18:23:01
    html_browser:     [IDLE]        last heartbeat: never

  Sync Configuration:
    Mode:             {sync_mode}
    Enabled:          {yes/no}
    Update Rate:      {rate_ms}ms

  System Consistency Check:
    App State:        [OK]
    Election Log:     [OK]
    Configuration:    [OK]

  Overall Status: {CONSISTENT / ANOMALY DETECTED}
    Details: {any anomalies found}

FIELD: System environment (app states, timestamps)
SELECTION: Check app status, verify recent heartbeat, verify state consistency
RECORD: Display status with consistency verdict

Five Gates:
  1. Alignment: Consistency check aligns with system state semantics
  2. Clarity: Each check explicit (heartbeat within threshold? files parseable?)
  3. Visibility: All checks shown, all data sources transparent
  4. Kindness: Grounds system in reality, detects problems early
  5. Scaling: O(1) checks per app, O(m) total where m = apps

Status: ZEROPOINT 18/18 (all gates pass)

---

## DASHBOARD 8: LEDGER (⟙)

Primitive: Integrity — Are all ledger files consistent and uncorrupted?

Data flow:
  ledger directory (all .jsonl files)
    → scan: each file
    → count: lines/entries
    → verify: each line is valid JSON
    → compute: file size, last write time
    → display: inventory table with status

Output format:
  Ledger — File Inventory & Integrity

  File Manifest:
  ────────────────────────────────────────  ──────  ────────  ──────────
  ledger_elections.jsonl                    309     45.2KB   [OK]
  ledger_app_state.jsonl                    101     12.1KB   [OK]
  ledger_dashboards.jsonl                   13      8.3KB    [OK]
  ledger_buttons.jsonl                      12      5.2KB    [OK]
  ledger_sync_config.json                   1       1.1KB    [OK]
  ledger_coherence_metrics.jsonl            {n}     {size}   [OK]
  ledger_parameters.jsonl                   {n}     {size}   [OK]
  ────────────────────────────────────────  ──────  ────────  ──────────

  Summary:
    Total Ledger Files:      {count}
    Total Entries:           {total_entries}
    Last Write:              {most_recent_timestamp}
    Overall Integrity:       [ALL OK / CORRUPTION DETECTED]

FIELD: Ledger file inventory
SELECTION: Scan all .jsonl files, verify parse, count entries
RECORD: Display table with per-file status

Five Gates:
  1. Alignment: File structure aligns with ledger format specification
  2. Clarity: Each file has clear status (OK or error details)
  3. Visibility: Self-referential (ledger audit shows ledger state)
  4. Kindness: Detects corruption early, helps debug issues
  5. Scaling: O(f) where f = number of files (small fixed set)

Status: ZEROPOINT 18/18 (all gates pass)

